WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:03.631
Unit twelve. Alcohol Poisoning!

2
00:00:04.585 --> 00:00:08.622
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.672 --> 00:00:11.794
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:15.545
Today we learn about Alcohol Poisoning. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.605 --> 00:00:21.255
Alcohol poisoning. Say it with me. Alcohol poisoning!

6
00:00:24.752 --> 00:00:29.219
Binge drinking. Say it with me. Binge drinking!

7
00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:37.026
Unconscious. Say it with me. Unconscious!

8
00:00:40.536 --> 00:00:44.269
Breathing. Say it with me. Breathing!

9
00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:52.331
Recovery position. Say it with me. Recovery position!

10
00:00:55.834 --> 00:00:59.484
Emergency. Say it with me. Emergency!

11
00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:06.335
Stay. Say it with me. Stay!

12
00:01:09.814 --> 00:01:13.164
Help. Say it with me. Help!

13
00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:28.288
Binge drinking can cause alcohol poisoning. Signs include being unconscious or slow breathing. Put the person in the recovery position, stay with them, and call emergency help.

14
00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:31.523
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:32.442 --> 00:01:37.756
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:39.127
Unconscious!

17
00:01:40.371 --> 00:01:45.587
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.637 --> 00:01:46.787
Stay!

19
00:01:47.926 --> 00:01:54.715
Did you know? A person with alcohol poisoning can choke on vomit, which is why the recovery position matters!

20
00:01:54.765 --> 00:01:56.901
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:58.046 --> 00:02:06.528
Think and answer. Why should you never leave a very drunk person alone?

22
00:02:06.578 --> 00:02:07.728
Great answer!

23
00:02:08.629 --> 00:02:13.610
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:16.310
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

